<title>USA: Thai Capital Fund's president resigns.</title>
<headline>Thai Capital Fund's president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>JERSEY CITY 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Capital Fund Inc said Wednesday Udom Vichayabhai had resigned as its president.</p>
<p>It said Udom had also retired on December 31 as president of the Mutual Fund Public Co Ltd, Thai Capital's investment manager. The fund did not give a reason for Udom's resignation from either post.</p>
<p>Damrongsuk Amatyakul, senior executive vice president of Mutual Fund, will serve as the acting president of Mutual Fund, it said. The fund did not say who would replace him in the Thai Capital Fund.</p>
</text>
